###  https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#InputYarnCountSpecification
:InputYarnCountSpecification rdf:type owl:Class ;
                             rdfs:subClassOf :FabricConstructionParameter ;
                             <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://susproc.jrc.ec.europa.eu/product-bureau/sites/default/files/2025-12/Textile-Prep-Study_3rd-Milestone_20251212.pdf> ;
                             rdfs:comment "A process target or input specification stating the yarn count or yarn linear-density class selected for fabric manufacturing."@en ;
                             rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process> ;
                             rdfs:label "Input yarn count specification"@en ;
                             <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "The JRC identifies yarn count as one of the weaving parameters affecting fabric characteristics. The exact target characteristic depends on fabric construction, yarn type and end use; therefore only weak influence annotations are used."@en ,
                                                                                      "The process-side target remains distinct from the resulting characteristic represented in Textile Structure."@en ,
                                                                                      "Yarn count is identified by the JRC as a fabric manufacturing parameter affecting fabric characteristics. A broad weak influence target is used here because the specific effect depends on yarn type, fabric construction and end use."@en ;
                             <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "JRC Preparatory Study, Section 13.10.2, printed pages 493-495, lines 11902-11920; JRC Preparatory Study, relevant section, Table 182, printed page 302; caption line 9114."@en ;
                             <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#adaptedDefinition> ;
                             <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicalInfluenceOn> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FabricCharacteristic> .


