                    <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "JRC Preparatory Study, Section 13.10.2, printed pages 492-493, lines 11889-11901; JRC Preparatory Study, relevant section, Table 181, printed page 302; caption line 9113."@en ;
